--- !u!114 &8432609253617020833
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 9136100421809631159}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 82c46054ae34cbc428a8c7dab43ce45d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isSkipping: 0
  backGround: {fileID: 4224577873251167828}
  mainAudioSource: {fileID: 3517445334223908544}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 5702847750937620185}
  skipButton: {fileID: 6317020304200972740}
  voiceOvers:
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b43518da2021a9459f065095df84b28, type: 3}
    voiceText: Welcome to Pawsome Farm, where Farmer Joe takes care of his beloved
      animals. Every day, he ensures they are happy, safe, and well-fed.
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ec8b45b4f4ea8ab4086780d5bb32c89f, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9707189e9ecc9a640b77d0cb247d62ae, type: 3}
    voiceText: Just as Farmer Joe was tending to his beloved animals,
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98c852e912caec24fbd05ca9cf56fff8, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ef21fda0caad9e4b8d2f153297c5e79, type: 3}
    voiceText: an unexpected call caught him off guard, pulling him away from his
      peaceful routine.
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98c852e912caec24fbd05ca9cf56fff8, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a1d12afd5f407b46b1fc59e351087e7, type: 3}
    voiceText: Without a second thought, Farmer Joe jumps into his tractor and speeds
      off, completely forgetting to lock the main gate.
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 33ba4089628600c4e868c0f2eefbf5a0, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a217efa637f3cf448a1937b3891fb6eb, type: 3}
    voiceText: "Little does he know, he\u2019s left the perfect opening for an unexpected
      adventure?"
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 33ba4089628600c4e868c0f2eefbf5a0, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 971fa814d9c7d2348a6af0c78ba19b57, type: 3}
    voiceText: "With the gate wide open, the animals couldn\u2019t resist the call
      of freedom."
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 600bc938c0b5487458376f1ff2c6df40, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51f889b1fce7d624aa6ebac9cc98fd09, type: 3}
    voiceText: In no time, they were racing out of the farm, eager to explore the
      world that lay beyond
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 600bc938c0b5487458376f1ff2c6df40, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 666e21057729edf489033f2298149fce, type: 3}
    voiceText: For the first time, the farm was silent and still.
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6a56ec3f0d1d0e43bce6e69a413fbab, type: 3}
  - voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3a6f966632f4e0440ab8afce9195e924, type: 3}
    voiceText: Every enclosure stood empty, the animals long gone on their unexpected
      adventure.
    backImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6a56ec3f0d1d0e43bce6e69a413fbab, type: 3}
  playerModel: {fileID: 0}
  audioSourceObj: {fileID: 0}
